WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.740
What a day we had...

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:03.000
It truly felt like an unknown power lead us on a journey throughout Europe.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:03.710
And yet...

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.890
what stood out the most for me was...

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.490
So scary!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.220
In the heat of the moment I didn't notice,

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:31.080
but I get frightened pretty easily!

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.870
Who in the world are they?!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:39.830
Either way, this journey across Europe worries me to no end!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.160
And yet...

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.010
And yet..!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:54.300
How am I supposed to sleep with this loud snoring right next to me?!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.560
I told you... I can't eat anymore.

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:17.300
The Dark Bladers Attack!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.830
Since our destination is Russia,

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.280
our best option is to cut through France first.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:46.500
Luckily, there's a train that can take us from London to Paris in about three hours.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:51.140
So if we take that, we'll be in Paris,
the city of flowers, in about three hours from now.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:55.210
But the English Channel runs between Great Britain and France, right?

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.050
So does this train come with floats?

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.160
There's an underwater tunnel!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.560
In fact, it runs right through the English Channel.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.300
Oh? Isn't that the train <i>we're</i> supposed to take?

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.370
Indeed!

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.880
It's a true high-tech train,
exceeding 300 kilometers per hour!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.300
It's known as the English Channel Express.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.320
Yahoo! Me first!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.670
What's wrong, Kai?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.340
Huh? All the seats are empty.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:52.730
I guess there aren't many people
traveling from France to the UK in the off-season.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.810
Eh, whatever. Let's depart!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.760
How strange... Wasn't that train
supposed to go back to the depot for repairs?

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.340
Oh, right...

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.710
Bollocks!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.000
Don't tell me..!

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:34.180
Forgive me, Father, for I have sinned.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.110
I... I stole the silver candelabra!

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:42.640
Be at ease, Jean Valjean.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.930
Inspector Chabert!

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:48.300
No, that's..!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:51.300
I've come for your blood, Jean Valjean...

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.240
I'll have your flesh!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.720
F-Father!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.200
We have to fight, Jean Valjean!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.100
F-Father! How am I supposed to defeat a werewolf?!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:09.600
Use a weapon forged from
silver! Werewolves cower to them!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.320
A silver weapon..?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.530
Why you..!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:18.580
<i>Why you..!</i>

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.970
This is one weird movie.

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.170
Really? I actually like it.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.410
It's in bad taste.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.280
But that's what makes it good!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.010
'The Devil's Bloody Miserables'.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.880
Ha! How profane!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:35.620
This was fun and all, but I'm
getting tired of this landscape.

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.890
How long is this going to take?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:44.880
If you're so bored, why don't you stop
watching dumb movies and start training instead?

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.340
What about you, Professor? What are you doing?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:51.130
Naturally, I'm analyzing data
in preparation for our upcoming battles.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:55.600
We still have a lot of weaknesses
we must overcome in order to win.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:07:01.850
You talk big, but I bet it's really 'cause
you're too scared to watch this movie!

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.580
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.870
How could I fear a movie so unscientific as this?!

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.370
No need to push yourself, Professor.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.900
Let's overcome our weaknesses, okay?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.130
W-W-What are you..?!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.040
Okay, Professor. Look this way, now...

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.870
See? There's a vampire <i>and</i> a werewolf!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.700
Stop it! Please, stop it!

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.120
Make sure to pay attention!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.480
We've entered the tunnel.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.460
Tails, huh...

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.980
Let's leave it there.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.060
This is no time to fool around, it seems.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.330
Aside from us, there are no passengers on the train.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.220
The whole thing is completely deserted.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.960
Deserted?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.740
I thought it was only this cabin...

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.590
Something about all this feels off.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.000
W-What's happening?!

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.410
The driver's seat was abandoned, too...

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.670
What's going on? How can even the driver be gone?!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.250
How can we be the only people on board?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.250
They got us.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.790
'They got us'? Who got us?

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:24.800
We'll find out soon enough.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.410
W-Wait, guys!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.100
Where are you going?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.960
Who's behind this, Kai?

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.450
Who would do something li—

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.990
I will destroy...

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.000
The World Tournament...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.660
will be destroyed.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:09.320
Y-You're..!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:12.390
It's the monks from the other day! Guess he wasn't alone...

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.050
T-This is terrible!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.890
What should we do?!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.150
For now, I'll run an analysis on them.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.820
I don't understand!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:30.860
A Bey...

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.300
Who the heck are you?!

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.350
My name is Blood.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:55.640
I am an apostle of darkness, wandering in search of blood.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:02.220
My name is Howly. An apostle of the beast, howling at the moon.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:08.230
I'm Cadav. An apostle of the undead, cursing fate itself.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.010
I don't care who you are.
What are you trying to pull here?

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.240
Even for a prank, this is going too far.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.340
We will destry the World Tournament.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.240
That is the mission of our team, Shadows.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:22.060
Team Shadows, huh? Cut the crap!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.130
Save me!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:26.760
Professor!

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:32.760
We meet again. My name is Phan,
apostle of souls who forever wander.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.680
What're you getting at, exactly?!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:59.040
Your road to the World Tournament... ends here.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.650
Are you saying you want to battle with us?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.290
You look to be the strongest.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.540
As such, you become my prey.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:28.940
No thanks.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:29.990
What?!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.440
I don't play with monsters.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:36.490
You..! Don't you care what happens to this guy?

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:40.210
Nope. Cook him, fry him... do whatever you want with him.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.900
Kai!

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:46.100
I'll do it! Professor, I'll come for you! Just wait a bit!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.460
I'm itching to fight, too!

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.280
Oh well.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:51.200
I can play along.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:56.760
Very well. We will give you
a taste of the power of darkness.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.470
Go, Dragoon!

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.360
Where did he vanish to?!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.900
Takao, above you!

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.400
What?!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.160
It's spinning on the ceiling?! I can't believe it!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.730
Witness the power of darkness!

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:33.150
My Bey, Dracuos, can hunt its prey from above.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.580
Just like a bat searching for blood.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:51.520
Dragoon!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:56.040
We will destroy each and
every Bey in the World Tournament!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.820
Take this! And this! And this!

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:18.010
I don't understand this 'power of darkness' crap,
but I won't let evil people like you have their way!

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:19.630
Dragoon!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.690
O-Oh, come on! Are you for real?!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.250
That's <i>unfair</i>!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.010
My Bey, Wulfos, does not obey the rules of battle.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.250
I simply follow my instincts to hunt prey.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.760
Then how's this? Draciel!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.970
Max! Let's show these guys our true power!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:02.880
<i>Okay</i>!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.600
Dragoon!

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.270
Draciel!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.840
Fools...

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.480
What?!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.370
We've been waiting for this moment!

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:23.470
Dracuos!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.180
Wulfos!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.920
Those are..!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.470
A-A vampire and a werewolf!

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.180
These must be Evil Sacred Beasts.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.950
Onward, our servants of darkness!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.670
Slaughter these Sacred Beasts!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.200
That's right! Absorb their life force.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.430
Leech every last drop from them!

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.450
Dragoon!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.780
Dragoon is losing its power.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.310
In return, Dracuos is absorbing it!

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.340
It's really like he's sucking its blood...

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:28.470
The invincible defender Draciel's
body is getting scratched to bits, too.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:33.020
Are you saying that even the mighty Genbu is powerless against a werewolf?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.890
Wait! I believe I've seen
this type of fight somewhere before...

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:44.760
Have you learned your lesson? We will send each and every Sacred Beast straight to Hell!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:50.960
Destroying the Sacred Beasts brings us great joy.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:53.410
I remember now!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:54.380
This is..!

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:58.110
Ralf also fought in the same fashion!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:08.160
Sure, these <i>look</i> like fearsome monsters,

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:11.100
but they're having the
Sacred Beasts fight all the same.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.680
Come to think of it, this man, too...

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.690
I should have realized this much sooner!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.740
They, too, are fighting using
the power of the Sacred Beasts!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:33.950
Takao! The Sacred Beasts!
Focus on the Sacred Beasts!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.700
Focus on the Sacred Beasts? What do you mean?

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:41.290
There must be... they must
have some kind of weakness!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.730
A weakness..?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.610
Dracula's weakness...

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.040
We have to fight, Jean Valjean!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.680
Of course..! Max!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:53.910
Okay!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.230
Dragoon!

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.410
Draciel!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.960
How dare you hurt my comrade's servant?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.170
Curse you!

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.290
Max!

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.430
Make use of the werewolf's weakness!

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.920
But...

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.090
Where do I find a silver weapon?!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.600
Fall to the depths of Hell!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.090
Hey, beast-boy.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:48.980
What?!

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:53.100
A-A silver coin?!

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:58.120
How about checking out Hell for yourself?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.370
Driger!

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.460
Alright!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.930
He did it!

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.050
Curse you, Sacred Beasts!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.650
Now that it's come to this..!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:27.980
I will fight you!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.140
Tsk. They've been a real nuisance.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:41.410
Remember—we will crush
your Sacred Beasts without fail.

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:52.200
They disappeared!

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.850
Kids! Are you alright?

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.220
Are you hurt anywwhere?

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.410
Oh, thank God you're all okay.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:08.020
At least this will get us to Paris before long.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.500
Team Shadows...

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.570
Who in the world are they?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:15.570
We still don't know anything.
However, I did notice something.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:20.780
Firstly, they are seriously planning to put an end to the World Tournament.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.770
If they attack all the participating teams,

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.790
the organizers will be forced to
cancel the Tournament altogether.

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:33.550
And then there's their clear
resentment for the Sacred Beasts.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.250
Now that you mention it...

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:40.080
We will crush your Sacred Beasts without fail.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.570
But why would they..?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:49.760
I don't know. But it appears they hate the Sacred Beasts even more than they do Bladers.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:50.760
Which is why...

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:52.640
They control the Evil Sacred Beasts.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:21:03.950
Indeed. We can safely assume that those monsters are the Evil Sacred Beats that Takao's father mentioned.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:08.700
They are able to freely control those Evil Sacred Beasts.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.490
Just like Ralf did.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.980
How are they able to control the Sacred Beasts?

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.990
What <i>are</i> the Sacred Beasts?

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:23.930
I think our questions may be answered in this journey across Europe.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.680
Sacred Beasts...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:01.890
According to my analysis,
we're in Paris, the city of flowers!

00:23:01.890 --> 00:23:05.900
Now's not the time to be saying <i>bonjour, mademoiselle</i>!

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:09.440
The Shadows that haunt us...

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:13.390
How could you attack us
right when Kai takes off?! You cowards!

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:16.010
Our final confrontation will be at the Eiffel Tower!

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:18.930
Next time: The Corps of the Black Shadows.

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:24.480
Not to nitpick, but aren't
you a bit too old to be kids?
